  "description": "COHCUZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C86 H68 Gd4 N20 O20,11(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.581-3.941 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.39-114.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C86H90Gd4N20O31. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
